    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d124-f1" n="12" type="source" xml:id="d124-f1-content">
                <p>No classification marking. The statement was issued after the meeting.
                    (Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, November 7, 1977, p.
                    640)</p>
            </note>
